{
  "schema": "openclaw_napm_summary_template.v1",
  "templateId": "napm_summary_overview_v1",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "titlePath": "title",
  "description": "NAPM 综述报告统一模板。通过 scopes 字段驱动章节显隐，一套模板覆盖全局综述、网络综述、业务综述、应用综述、业务组综述和告警综述。",
  "page": {
    "margin": {
      "top": 1000,
      "right": 900,
      "bottom": 1000,
      "left": 900,
      "header": 450,
      "footer": 450
    },
    "header": {
      "leftImage": {
        "path": "templates/inspection/company-logo.png",
        "width": 110,
        "height": 32,
        "alt": "网深科技流量分析系统"
      },
      "left": "网深科技流量分析系统",
      "right": "{{summary.customerName}}{{summary.projectName}}{{scope.label}}报告"
    },
    "footer": {
      "center": "第 {{pageNumber}} 页 / 共 {{totalPages}} 页",
      "right": "{{summary.reportDate}}"
    }
  },
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "cover",
      "type": "cover",
      "title": "网深科技流量分析系统",
      "subtitle": "{{scope.label}}报告"
    },
    {
      "id": "cover_date",
      "type": "paragraphs",
      "alignment": "center",
      "size": 22,
      "paragraphs": [
        "{{summary.reportDate}}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cover_break",
      "type": "pageBreak"
    },
    {
      "id": "toc",
      "type": "toc",
      "title": "目录",
      "alias": "Summary Report TOC",
      "headingStyleRange": "1-2",
      "hyperlink": true,
      "updateMode": "wordField"
    },
    {
      "id": "toc_break",
      "type": "pageBreak"
    },

    {
      "id": "overview_heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "1 报告概述",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "overview_scope_info",
      "type": "paragraphs",
      "paragraphs": [
        "综述范围：{{scope.label}}",
        "时间范围：{{timeRange.displayText}}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "overview_scope_target",
      "type": "paragraphs",
      "scopes": ["webApplication", "application", "businessGroup", "network"],
      "paragraphs": [
        "聚焦对象：{{scope.target.groupLabel}}（{{scope.target.groupType}}）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "device_info_heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "设备信息",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "device_info_intro",
      "type": "paragraphs",
      "paragraphs": [
        "本次综述涉及的 NetInside 流量分析系统设备信息如下："
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "device_info_table",
      "type": "table",
      "rowBuilder": "summaryDeviceTable",
      "columns": [
        "编号",
        "系统名称",
        "IP地址",
        "软件版本",
        "序列号",
        "启动时长"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "health_heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "综合健康评估",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "health_table",
      "type": "table",
      "rowBuilder": "healthSummary",
      "columns": [
        "评估维度",
        "状态",
        "说明"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "health_narrative",
      "type": "narrative",
      "ruleGroup": "overview.health",
      "mode": "first"
    },

    {
      "id": "alert_heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "2 告警态势",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "alert_requirement",
      "type": "paragraphs",
      "paragraphs": [
        "以下数据来源于 NetInside 流量分析系统的告警模块，统计周期内产生的所有告警记录。告警类别包括：网络性能告警、网络异常告警、应用性能告警、业务故障告警、用户体验告警、安全事件告警、智能分析告警。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "alert_stats_heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "告警概览",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "alert_stats_table",
      "type": "table",
      "rowBuilder": "alertCategoryStats",
      "columns": [
        "告警类别",
        "总数",
        "紧急",
        "重大",
        "轻微"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "alert_trend_heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "告警趋势",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "alert_trend_chart",
      "type": "chartSlot",
      "title": "告警趋势图",
      "chartId": "alert.timeline"
    },
    {
      "id": "alert_top_objects_heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "Top 告警对象",
      "level": 2,
      "scopes": ["global"]
    },
    {
      "id": "alert_top_objects_table",
      "type": "table",
      "rowBuilder": "alertTopObjects",
      "scopes": ["global"],
      "columns": [
        "对象名称",
        "对象类型",
        "告警总数",
        "紧急",
        "重大",
        "轻微"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "alert_unresolved_heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "未恢复告警",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "alert_unresolved_table",
      "type": "table",
      "rowBuilder": "unresolvedAlerts",
      "columns": [
        "告警ID",
        "告警名称",
        "级别",
        "类别",
        "对象",
        "开始时间"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "alert_narrative",
      "type": "narrative",
      "ruleGroup": "alert.conclusion",
      "mode": "first"
    },

    {
      "id": "traffic_heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "3 流量总览",
      "level": 1,
      "scopes": ["global", "network", "application", "businessGroup"]
    },
    {
      "id": "traffic_requirement",
      "type": "paragraphs",
      "scopes": ["global", "network", "application", "businessGroup"],
      "paragraphs": [
        "以下数据展示报告周期内的流量与性能指标排行。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "traffic_trend_heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "流量趋势",
      "level": 2,
      "scopes": ["global", "network", "businessGroup"]
    },
    {
      "id": "traffic_trend_chart",
      "type": "chartSlot",
      "title": "流量趋势图",
      "chartId": "traffic.trend",
      "scopes": ["global", "network", "businessGroup"]
    },
    {
      "id": "traffic_quality_heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "流量质量指标",
      "level": 2,
      "scopes": ["network", "businessGroup"]
    },
    {
      "id": "traffic_quality_table",
      "type": "table",
      "rowBuilder": "trafficQualityMetrics",
      "scopes": ["network", "businessGroup"],
      "columns": [
        "指标",
        "当前值",
        "均值",
        "峰值",
        "状态"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "traffic_top_heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "流量对象排行",
      "level": 2,
      "scopes": ["global", "network", "application", "businessGroup"]
    },
    {
      "id": "traffic_top_ip_table",
      "type": "table",
      "rowBuilder": "trafficTopIPs",
      "scopes": ["global", "network"],
      "caption": "Top 10 流量 IP",
      "columns": [
        "序号",
        "IP地址",
        "总流量(kb/s)",
        "入流量(kb/s)",
        "出流量(kb/s)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "traffic_top_app_table",
      "type": "table",
      "rowBuilder": "trafficTopApps",
      "scopes": ["global", "network", "application", "businessGroup"],
      "caption": "Top 10 流量应用",
      "columns": [
        "序号",
        "应用名称",
        "总流量(kb/s)",
        "入流量(kb/s)",
        "出流量(kb/s)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "traffic_drilldown_heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "下级维度分布",
      "level": 2,
      "scopes": ["network", "businessGroup"]
    },
    {
      "id": "traffic_drilldown_table",
      "type": "table",
      "rowBuilder": "trafficDrillDown",
      "scopes": ["network", "businessGroup"],
      "columns": [
        "序号",
        "对象名称",
        "总流量",
        "入流量",
        "出流量"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "app_connections_heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "连接数排行",
      "level": 2,
      "scopes": ["application"]
    },
    {
      "id": "app_connections_table",
      "type": "table",
      "rowBuilder": "appConnections",
      "scopes": ["application"],
      "caption": "Top 10 连接数",
      "columns": [
        "序号",
        "应用名称",
        "连接数(入)",
        "连接数(出)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "app_failures_heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "连接失败排行",
      "level": 2,
      "scopes": ["application"]
    },
    {
      "id": "app_failures_table",
      "type": "table",
      "rowBuilder": "appFailures",
      "scopes": ["application"],
      "caption": "Top 10 连接失败",
      "columns": [
        "序号",
        "应用名称",
        "失败数(出)",
        "失败数(入)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "app_quality_heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "应用质量排行",
      "level": 2,
      "scopes": ["application"]
    },
    {
      "id": "app_quality_table",
      "type": "table",
      "rowBuilder": "appQuality",
      "scopes": ["application"],
      "caption": "Top 10 丢包与延迟",
      "columns": [
        "序号",
        "应用名称",
        "丢包率(入)%",
        "丢包率(出)%",
        "RTT(入)ms",
        "RTT(出)ms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "traffic_narrative",
      "type": "narrative",
      "ruleGroup": "traffic.conclusion",
      "mode": "first",
      "scopes": ["global", "network", "webApplication", "application", "businessGroup"]
    },

    {
      "id": "business_heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "4 业务性能总览",
      "level": 1,
      "scopes": ["global", "webApplication"]
    },
    {
      "id": "business_requirement",
      "type": "paragraphs",
      "scopes": ["global", "webApplication"],
      "paragraphs": [
        "以下数据展示报告周期内业务性能状况，重点关注慢访问和 HTTP 错误。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "business_slow_heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "慢访问状况",
      "level": 2,
      "scopes": ["global", "webApplication"]
    },
    {
      "id": "business_slow_chart",
      "type": "chartSlot",
      "title": "慢访问 Top",
      "chartId": "business.slowAccess",
      "scopes": ["global", "webApplication"]
    },
    {
      "id": "business_error_heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "HTTP 错误状况",
      "level": 2,
      "scopes": ["global", "webApplication"]
    },
    {
      "id": "business_error_chart",
      "type": "chartSlot",
      "title": "HTTP 错误 Top",
      "chartId": "business.httpErrors",
      "scopes": ["global", "webApplication"]
    },
    {
      "id": "business_page_traffic_heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "页面流量排行",
      "level": 2,
      "scopes": ["webApplication"]
    },
    {
      "id": "business_page_traffic_table",
      "type": "table",
      "rowBuilder": "businessPageTraffic",
      "scopes": ["webApplication"],
      "caption": "Top 10 页面流量",
      "columns": [
        "序号",
        "业务名称",
        "请求流量(kb/s)",
        "响应流量(kb/s)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "business_page_views_heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "页面访问量排行",
      "level": 2,
      "scopes": ["webApplication"]
    },
    {
      "id": "business_page_views_table",
      "type": "table",
      "rowBuilder": "businessPageViews",
      "scopes": ["webApplication"],
      "caption": "Top 10 页面访问量",
      "columns": [
        "序号",
        "业务名称",
        "页面访问数"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "business_narrative",
      "type": "narrative",
      "ruleGroup": "business.conclusion",
      "mode": "first",
      "scopes": ["global", "webApplication"]
    },

    {
      "id": "conclusion_heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "5 结论与建议",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "conclusion_narrative",
      "type": "narrative",
      "ruleGroup": "summary.conclusion",
      "mode": "first"
    },
    {
      "id": "conclusion_recommendations",
      "type": "dataParagraphs",
      "label": "建议事项：",
      "dataPath": "summary.recommendations",
      "emptyText": "无特别建议。"
    }
  ]
}
